        <mxCell id="v83" value="Each diamond is one if-statement at the top of Reserve():&lt;br&gt;1. if (!stay.IsValid()) return InvalidDates&lt;br&gt;2. if (store.HasOverlap(room, stay)) return Unavailable&lt;br&gt;Trace: Omar R7 13–15 (Maya has 12–14): Yes, Yes (night of the 13th) → Unavailable." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
